<title>UK: Timah at 11.64 in London at 0825 GMT.</title>
<headline>Timah at 11.64 in London at 0825 GMT.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>PT Tambang Timah was traded at $11.64 per GDR in London on Monday at around 0825 GMT.</p>
<p>It recorded a low of $11.5 and a high of $11.665.</p>
<p>Its previous close on Friday was $11.3. One Global Depository Receipt represents 10 common shares.</p>
<p>-- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364</p>
</text>
